nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3677bcefd4c6">The code connects to the tradecard membership =
in the membership lane in the probuild pool. It allows the user task in web=
site to connect to the trade card membership database</p></td>
<td colspan=3D"3" data-local-id=3D"4bca7b73-dda3-4f65-8496-cdbad72a323a" cl=
ass=3D"confluenceTd">
