<p local-id=3D"69cb22b7977d">&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"8b31c12b94a3">(Don't focus on the service tasks in the custo=
mer pool, as they are mainly just connected to pre-developed service tasks)=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"9f3e6f7ed6b0"></p>
<p local-id=3D"12ad8e044ec2">Probuild pool</p>
