nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3f507434715c">This service task processes online orders and =
connects to the website form to get key info.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4115b49b703d"></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"7c8a8c8e-71ba-49f1-95b7-59470fcd925b">
<li local-id=3D"84e5e3f0-0edb-4b41-9f47-075020308d67">
<p local-id=3D"e683c63dd671">Code must generate an order ID</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3f7e3d6b-960d-4453-b8a4-b9b141053e2c">
<p local-id=3D"a8daf42dbb99">What the process is (buy, hire, membership act=
ivation) key: mainSelection</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f469b536-c95a-48b7-992e-e544eff5d6c8">
<p local-id=3D"a0ebd554b869">Must get the cost of the order</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5c1c6117-f2db-48a2-9159-7dbaf65aa87d">
<p local-id=3D"319e05c550bb">The selected goods</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37a7db59-1eba-4573-abb6-83a98f7f1c6a">
<p local-id=3D"adeb01fd872d">Address of customer path =3DAddress</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"69c1eb3c-f486-449d-8c8c-67cacc1318cd">
<p local-id=3D"d7eb11479035">Payment type: finance or card key: purchasePay=
ment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6dce2149-818b-4815-8dd8-c24d388a14b0">
<p local-id=3D"f104c9d101cf">Trade card membership details path: TradeCard<=
/p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"145a149f5a22"></p></td>
